  "title": "Single image molecular tagging velocimetry",
  "abstract": "© 2020 IOP Publishing Ltd.A single-image nitric-oxide molecular tagging velocimetry (NO-MTV) is reported and employed in a real air driven hypersonic shock tunnel and provided velocities of 3240 170(5.2%) and 3030 160(5.3%) m , insignificantly different from previous results of 3037 98(3.2%) obtained by an ordinary multi-image MTV technique. The proposed methodology relies on an one-dimensional analytical description of the spatial intensity profile registered by a single MTV image.",
